VIEWMODEL.md G13: a search term of a type that cannot be searched (a record, a Bool, a list of records, an optional list) is E1622; text, a number, an enum, a ref, an optional of one and a list of one are fine.
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local enum Rarity { common, rare }

local record Size {
  w: Int
}

local record Item {
  label: String
  size: Size
  on: Bool
  sizes: [Size]
  count: Int?
  rarities: [Rarity]
  maybe: [String]?
}

view Item {
  search { label, size, on, sizes, count, rarities, label.len(), maybe }
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E1622]  a/a.canon:20:19
  a search term must be text, a number, an enum, a ref or an asset, not a.Size

error[E1622]  a/a.canon:20:25
  a search term must be text, a number, an enum, a ref or an asset, not Bool

error[E1622]  a/a.canon:20:29
  a search term must be text, a number, an enum, a ref or an asset, not [a.Size]

error[E1622]  a/a.canon:20:66
  a search term must be text, a number, an enum, a ref or an asset, not [String]?

4 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
